(6594392, 983547, 49018, '<td valign="top">A really effective image, the lack of details elsewhere locks up the viewer eye between the two eyes, the gun''s and the man''s. Actually, this would have been quite effective for the golden ratio challenge too (and probably demolished for the shallow dof, which is obviously what makes the image:) I can''t vote, but I just love this, good job!<br/> <br/>(edited for spelling mistakes)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-11-21 20:02:03.</i></td>', 'A really effective image, the lack of details elsewhere locks up the viewer eye between the two eyes, the gun''s and the man''s. Actually, this would have been quite effective for the golden ratio challenge too (and probably demolished for the shallow dof, which is obviously what makes the image:) I can''t vote, but I just love this, good job! (edited for spelling mistakes)', '2011-11-14 06:37:49.000000', '2011-11-21 20:02:03.000000', 1),
