(6594395, 983516, 49018, '<td valign="top">Very interesting framing, turning the scar into an asset (unless it''s not a real scar, at which point it would be a fake defect turned into a real asset.. uhh.. I''m getting confused :) Very good image (non voter)</td>', 'Very interesting framing, turning the scar into an asset (unless it''s not a real scar, at which point it would be a fake defect turned into a real asset.. uhh.. I''m getting confused :) Very good image (non voter)', '2011-11-14 06:40:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594399, 983641, 49018, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a tighter crop, leaving all ropes extend beyond the frame, would have worked differently, making for a more mysterious image (or maybe it is already so to most viewers, probalby I go to the playground too often :)</td>', 'I wonder if a tighter crop, leaving all ropes extend beyond the frame, would have worked differently, making for a more mysterious image (or maybe it is already so to most viewers, probalby I go to the playground too often :)', '2011-11-14 06:44:58.000000', NULL, 1),
