(6594436, 983727, 124982, '<td valign="top">Wonderful capture. Such a beautiful model and so nicely shot. Love the detail and lighting. Did you selectively remove grain from the eyes to keep them sharp? I''m 73 votes into this challenge, and this is my favorite.</td>', 'Wonderful capture. Such a beautiful model and so nicely shot. Love the detail and lighting. Did you selectively remove grain from the eyes to keep them sharp? I''m 73 votes into this challenge, and this is my favorite.', '2011-11-14 08:07:18.000000', NULL, 1),
