(6594559, 983900, 30861, '<td valign="top">The winner in my book, so far. Fairly sublime image, and the grain is integral to it.</td>', 'The winner in my book, so far. Fairly sublime image, and the grain is integral to it.', '2011-11-14 11:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594564, 983690, 30861, '<td valign="top">I really really really wish you''d rotated this to square up the verticals at the door in the BG. It looks like you''ve used the shelving on the right as your vertical reference, and that doesn''t work; you need to square the most central verticals; the door and the stovepipe. Then, if necessary, you can use some skew or perspective adjustment to control the edges.<br/> <br/>Aside from this nagging vertical issue, it''s an absolutely wonderful image. It just REEKS of another time and pl;ace. Well done.</td>', 'I really really really wish you''d rotated this to square up the verticals at the door in the BG. It looks like you''ve used the shelving on the right as your vertical reference, and that doesn''t work; you need to square the most central verticals; the door and the stovepipe. Then, if necessary, you can use some skew or perspective adjustment to control the edges. Aside from this nagging vertical issue, it''s an absolutely wonderful image. It just REEKS of another time and pl;ace. Well done.', '2011-11-14 11:32:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594566, 983528, 30861, '<td valign="top">SC will fix spelling on title if you send them a ticket. Should be "Despair". Wonderful shot.</td>', 'SC will fix spelling on title if you send them a ticket. Should be "Despair". Wonderful shot.', '2011-11-14 11:34:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594569, 983465, 30861, '<td valign="top">Do you mean "palette"? A "palate" is about taste, a "palette" is about color and tone. SC will fix this title if you send them a ticket, which I''d do if I were you. Very nice shot.</td>', 'Do you mean "palette"? A "palate" is about taste, a "palette" is about color and tone. SC will fix this title if you send them a ticket, which I''d do if I were you. Very nice shot.', '2011-11-14 11:36:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594572, 983592, 30861, '<td valign="top">One of the best in the challenge. Quite haunting, and the noise is integral to the image.</td>', 'One of the best in the challenge. Quite haunting, and the noise is integral to the image.', '2011-11-14 11:37:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6594573, 983294, 30861, '<td valign="top">Looks like Old Havana... Cool shot in principle, but the processing''s a little too overcooked and the sharpening a little too extreme for this to show at its best.</td>', 'Looks like Old Havana... Cool shot in principle, but the processing''s a little too overcooked and the sharpening a little too extreme for this to show at its best.', '2011-11-14 11:39:24.000000', NULL, 1),
