(6595474, 983878, 17507, '<td valign="top">Reminds me of <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=30861" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">Bear_Music</a>. The grain is useful here: along with the fog on the water, the lonely-looking boat, and the low-contrast processing, the grain adds to the sense of desolation and old-timeiness. Nicely done.</td>', 'Reminds me of  Bear_Music. The grain is useful here: along with the fog on the water, the lonely-looking boat, and the low-contrast processing, the grain adds to the sense of desolation and old-timeiness. Nicely done.', '2011-11-15 12:11:18.000000', NULL, 1),
