(6595608, 983223, 17507, '<td valign="top">Great shot. Love the photo. But where''s the grain? I see a tiny bit in the ceiling panels, but to me, it''s irrelevant to the photo, the composition, the mood, the impact.</td>', 'Great shot. Love the photo. But where''s the grain? I see a tiny bit in the ceiling panels, but to me, it''s irrelevant to the photo, the composition, the mood, the impact.', '2011-11-15 16:15:09.000000', NULL, 1),
