(6599292, 983494, 124815, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Something though looks out of proportion. Perhaps more space was needed, or more height. It looks a little chunky.</td>', 'Interesting. Something though looks out of proportion. Perhaps more space was needed, or more height. It looks a little chunky.', '2011-11-20 21:44:26.000000', NULL, 1),
