(6599320, 983465, 124815, '<td valign="top">Perhaps tenebrous palace? It''s too muddy but the garbage looks terrific. Some kind of an illusion this man with glasses on the post. The greenery is not necessarily needed. Perhaps you can revisit the spot and wait for the pigeon also.</td>', 'Perhaps tenebrous palace? It''s too muddy but the garbage looks terrific. Some kind of an illusion this man with glasses on the post. The greenery is not necessarily needed. Perhaps you can revisit the spot and wait for the pigeon also.', '2011-11-20 22:07:26.000000', NULL, 1),
