(6599896, 983281, 19708, '<td valign="top">You Rock.<br/>A skiff and a title, defined, with a comma in the middle.<br/>A true signature my friend.<br/> <br/>You should send that 5D in for service, as there is probably something<br/>wrong with the sensor. I mean look at the graininess at ISO 200.<br/>It looks good in this image, but ISO 200 should be a little cleaner.<br/>*grin*</td>', 'You Rock.A skiff and a title, defined, with a comma in the middle.A true signature my friend. You should send that 5D in for service, as there is probably somethingwrong with the sensor. I mean look at the graininess at ISO 200.It looks good in this image, but ISO 200 should be a little cleaner.*grin*', '2011-11-21 09:07:26.000000', NULL, 0),
