(6600666, 983921, 53814, '<td valign="top">Next time, for a better composition, I would line up every goose with a pylon. The left goose is fine as is. The second goose should be placed where the third goose is at now. The third goose should be moved to the right, one pylon. The forth goose should be moved slightly to the left nearest pylon. The fifth goose should be moved to the right pylon. <br/> <br/>Hope this helps.<br/> <br/>btw... If you need further pointers on how-to-place-your-goose, feel free to ask.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-11-27 23:29:16.</i></td>', 'Next time, for a better composition, I would line up every goose with a pylon. The left goose is fine as is. The second goose should be placed where the third goose is at now. The third goose should be moved to the right, one pylon. The forth goose should be moved slightly to the left nearest pylon. The fifth goose should be moved to the right pylon.  Hope this helps. btw... If you need further pointers on how-to-place-your-goose, feel free to ask.', '2011-11-22 02:03:28.000000', '2011-11-27 23:29:16.000000', 0),
